418					color: inherit;
419					text-decoration: underline;
420				}
421				a[href^="http"]::after {
422					content: " (" attr(href) ")";
423					font-size: 0.85em;
424					font-weight: normal;
425				}
426				.card {
427					border: none;
428					break-inside: avoid;
429				}
430			}
431		</style>
432	</head>
433	<body>
434		<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
435		<header id="top">
436			<h1>Welcome</h1>
437			<nav aria-label="Page sections">
438				<ul>
439					<li><a href="#features">Features</a></li>
440					<li><a href="#examples">Examples</a></li>
441					<li><a href="#resources">Resources</a></li>
442				</ul>
443			</nav>
444		</header>
445		<main id="main" tabindex="-1">
446			<section aria-label="Introduction">
447				<p>This is a well-structured, accessible HTML5 document demonstrating modern best practices for semantic markup and inclusive design.</p>
448				<p>
449					It uses semantic landmarks, a skip link for keyboard navigation,
450					and CSS that adapts to your light or dark mode preference.
451				</p>
452				<p>
453					Text and link colors meet WCAG AA contrast in both themes, type scales
454					with your browser's font size, and motion respects your system settings.
455				</p>
456			</section>
457	
458			<section aria-labelledby="features">
459				<h2 id="features">Features</h2>
460				<ul>
461					<li>Semantic HTML structure with proper landmarks</li>
462					<li>Keyboard accessible navigation and focus management</li>
463					<li>Dark mode support with custom color schemes</li>
464					<li>Responsive typography using modern CSS</li>
465					<li>Print-friendly styles for better readability</li>
466					<li>WCAG AA contrast compliance in all color modes</li>
467				</ul>
468			</section>
469	
470			<section aria-labelledby="examples">
471				<h2 id="examples">Examples</h2>
472				<article class="card">
473					<h3>Component Cards</h3>
474					<p>Card components are useful for organizing related content. They include a subtle border and padding for visual separation.</p>
475					<a class="button" href="#resources">Learn more<span class="visually-hidden"> about accessibility resources</span></a>
476				</article>
477	
478				<article class="card">
479					<h3>Interactive Elements</h3>
480					<p>Buttons and links are fully accessible with clear focus states. All interactive elements include visible focus indicators and proper ARIA labels.</p>
481					<p><strong>Keyboard navigation:</strong> Use <kbd>Tab</kbd> to move forward, <kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>Tab</kbd> to move backward, and <kbd>Enter</kbd> to activate.</p>
482				</article>
483	
484				<article class="card">
485					<h3>Accessible Form</h3>
486					<form id="contact-form" novalidate>
487						<p class="form-hint">Fields marked * are required.</p>
488						<div class="field">
489							<label for="email">Email <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
490							<input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="none" required aria-describedby="email-help">
491							<span id="email-error" class="error-message" role="alert"></span>
492							<small id="email-help" class="form-hint">For example, name@example.com</small>
493						</div>
494						<div class="field">
495							<label for="message">Message</label>
496							<textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" maxlength="2000" aria-describedby="message-help"></textarea>
497							<small id="message-help" class="form-hint">Up to 2,000 characters.</small>
498						</div>
499						<button type="submit">Send message</button>
500						<p id="form-status" role="status"></p>
501					</form>
502				</article>
503	
504				<article class="card">
505					<h3>Live Region Example</h3>
506					<p>Click the button to announce a message using a live region. This demonstrates how screen readers are notified of dynamic updates.</p>
507					<button id="announce" type="button">Announce message</button>
508					<div class="live-region" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
509						<span id="live-message"></span>
510					</div>
511				</article>
512	
513				<article class="card">
514					<h3>Interactive Counter</h3>
515					<p>This counter demonstrates state management and ARIA live regions for accessible dynamic content.</p>
516					<div class="counter">
517						<button id="decrease" type="button" aria-label="Decrease count">−</button>
518						<output id="count" aria-live="off">0</output>
519						<button id="increase" type="button" aria-label="Increase count">+</button>
520						<button id="reset" type="button">Reset</button>
521					</div>
522					<div class="live-region" aria-live="polite">
523						<span id="count-message"></span>
524					</div>
525				</article>
526			</section>
527	
528			<section aria-labelledby="resources">
529				<h2 id="resources">Resources</h2>
530				<p>Want to learn more about web accessibility and semantic HTML? Check out these resources:</p>
531				<ul>
532					<li><a href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/quickref/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WCAG 2.2 Quick Reference<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in new tab)</span></a></li>
533					<li><a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">HTML Living Standard<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in new tab)</span></a></li>
534					<li><a href="https://www.a11y-101.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">A11y 101<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in new tab)</span></a></li>
535				</ul>
536			</section>
537		</main>
538		<footer>
539			<nav aria-label="Footer links">
540				<ul>
541					<li><a href="#top">Back to top</a></li>
542					<li><a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in new tab)</span></a></li>
543				</ul>
544			</nav>
545			<p><small>&copy; <time datetime="2026">2026</time>. All rights reserved.</small></p>
546		</footer>
547		<script>
548			const messages = [
549				"This update was announced to screen readers!",
550				"Dynamic content updates work with aria-live regions.",
551				"Live regions are essential for accessible web apps.",
552				"Try this with a screen reader like NVDA or JAWS!"
553			];
554			let nextMessage = 0;
555			let count = 0;
556			const announceBtn = document.getElementById('announce');
557			const contactForm = document.getElementById('contact-form');
558			const emailInput = document.getElementById('email');
559			const formStatus = document.getElementById('form-status');
560			const countDisplay = document.getElementById('count');
561			const countMessage = document.getElementById('count-message');
562			const decreaseBtn = document.getElementById('decrease');
563			const increaseBtn = document.getElementById('increase');
564			const resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');
565	
566			const updateCountDisplay = () => {
567				countDisplay.textContent = count;
568				countMessage.textContent = `Count is now ${count}.`;
569			};
570	
571			if (decreaseBtn) {
572				decreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
573					count--;
574					updateCountDisplay();
575				});
576			}
577	
578			if (increaseBtn) {
579				increaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
580					count++;
581					updateCountDisplay();
582				});
583			}
584	
585			if (resetBtn) {
586				resetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
587					count = 0;
588					updateCountDisplay();
589				});
590			}
591	
592			if (announceBtn) {
593				announceBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
594					document.getElementById('live-message').textContent = messages[nextMessage];
595					nextMessage = (nextMessage + 1) % messages.length;
596				});
597			}
598	
599			if (contactForm) {
600				const emailError = document.getElementById('email-error');
601	
602				const validateEmail = () => {
603					let message = '';
604					if (emailInput.validity.valueMissing) {
605						message = 'Enter your email address.';
606					} else if (!emailInput.validity.valid) {
607						message = 'Enter an email address in the format name@example.com.';
608					}
609					emailError.textContent = message;
610					if (message) {
611						emailInput.setAttribute('aria-invalid', 'true');
612						emailInput.setAttribute('aria-describedby', 'email-error email-help');
613					} else {
614						emailInput.removeAttribute('aria-invalid');
615						emailInput.setAttribute('aria-describedby', 'email-help');
616					}
617					return !message;
618				};
619	
620				emailInput.addEventListener('blur', () => {
621					if (emailInput.value || emailInput.hasAttribute('aria-invalid')) {
622						validateEmail();
623					}
624				});
625	
626				emailInput.addEventListener('input', () => {
627					if (emailInput.hasAttribute('aria-invalid')) {
628						validateEmail();
629					}
630				});
631	
632				contactForm.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
633					event.preventDefault();
634					formStatus.textContent = '';
635					if (!validateEmail()) {
636						emailInput.focus();
637						return;
638					}
639					contactForm.reset();
640					emailError.textContent = '';
641					emailInput.removeAttribute('aria-invalid');
642					emailInput.setAttribute('aria-describedby', 'email-help');
